%!PS-Adobe-3.0 EPSF-3.0
%%BoundingBox: 0 0 300 200
%%EndComments
/Helvetica findfont 12 scalefont setfont
10 10 moveto (show) show
10 30 moveto 2 0 (ashow) ashow
10 50 moveto 3 0 32 (width show) widthshow
10 70 moveto 1 0 32 1 0 (awidth show) awidthshow
10 90 moveto (xy) [10 0 10 0] xyshow
10 110 moveto (xs) [10 10] xshow
10 130 moveto (ys) [10 10] yshow
(width) stringwidth pop pop
/Times-Roman 14 selectfont 150 10 moveto (selectfont) show
/Courier findfont [10 0 0 12 0 0] makefont setfont 150 30 moveto (makefont) show
currentfont pop
/Helvetica-Bold findfont 20 scalefont setfont 150 60 moveto (Bold) true charpath stroke
2 setlinewidth 150 90 moveto { pop pop 1 0 rmoveto } (kshow) kshow
150 100 moveto { pop pop } (cshow) cshow
/MyFont /Helvetica findfont dup length dict copy definefont pop
/MyFont 10 selectfont 150 120 moveto (defined) show
/Helvetica findfont 12 scalefont setfont 0 1 0 setrgbcolor 30 rotate 150 140 moveto (rotated) show
/Helvetica findfont 12 scalefont setfont 10 150 moveto () show
showpage
%%EOF
